Modify the given code to implement memoization to optimize the recursive Fibonacci sequence calculation. The Fibonacci sequence is defined as: fib(0) = 0, fib(1) = 1, fib(n) = fib(n-1) + fib(n-2) for n > 1.
def fibonacci(n):
    if n <= 1:
        return n
    else:
        return fibonacci(n-1) + fibonacci(n-2)<|im_end|>
