Optimize the following Python code to find the median of an array in O(n) time complexity. ```python
def find_median(arr):
    arr.sort()
    n = len(arr)
    if n % 2 == 0:
        return (arr[n//2 - 1] + arr[n//2]) / 2
    else:
        return arr[n//2]
```<|im_end|>
