Refactor the following piece of code to improve its readability and performance.
```python
def calc(a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h):
    if a>b:
        x=a-b
    else:
        x=b-a
    if c>d:
        y=c-d
    else:
        y=d-c
    if e>f:
        z=e-f
    else:
        z=f-e
    if g>h:
        w=g-h
    else:
        w=h-g
    return (x+y+z+w)/4
```<|im_end|>
