Convert the given C++ code to Python. The code defines a class that includes two member functions: one for adding an element to the data structure and another for returning the maximum element.
```cpp
class MaxStack {
private:
    vector<int> data;

public:
    void push(int x) {
        data.push_back(x);
    }

    int getMax() {
        if (data.empty()) return -1;
        return *max_element(data.begin(), data.end());
    }
};
```<|im_end|>
